THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL REDISTRIBUTED IN THIS REPOSITORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository vendors eight configuration and behavior-tree files from the
ROS 2 Navigation2 project so that the demo and the regression tests run against
real upstream artifacts rather than hand-written imitations of them.

  Project:  Navigation2 (Nav2)
  Source:   https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2
  Commit:   075b29611a7d21ff4f1c74077a17c672e708001c
  Retrieved: 2026-08-13
  License:  Apache License 2.0

  Navigation2 as a whole is multi-licensed (LGPL-2.1-or-later, Apache-2.0,
  BSD-3-Clause, and Apache-2.0 AND BSD-3-Clause), with the applicable license
  declared per package in that package's package.xml. Every file vendored here
  comes from a package whose package.xml declares Apache-2.0:

    nav2_bringup        Apache-2.0
    nav2_bt_navigator   Apache-2.0
    nav2_system_tests   Apache-2.0

  Files, all reproduced byte-for-byte with no modification:

    tests/fixtures/nav2_upstream_params/nav2_params.yaml
      <- nav2_bringup/params/nav2_params.yaml
    tests/fixtures/nav2_upstream_params/nav2_system_params.yaml
      <- nav2_system_tests/src/system/nav2_system_params.yaml
    tests/fixtures/nav2_upstream_params/nav2_no_map_params.yaml
      <- nav2_system_tests/src/gps_navigation/nav2_no_map_params.yaml
    tests/fixtures/nav2_upstream_bt/follow_point.xml
    tests/fixtures/nav2_upstream_bt/navigate_through_poses_w_replanning_and_recovery.xml
    tests/fixtures/nav2_upstream_bt/navigate_to_pose_w_replanning_and_recovery.xml
    tests/fixtures/nav2_upstream_bt/navigate_w_replanning_speed.xml
    tests/fixtures/nav2_upstream_bt/odometry_calibration.xml
      <- nav2_bt_navigator/behavior_trees/

  The SHA-256 of every one of these files is recorded in demo/provenance.json,
  and both the demo and the evaluation harness verify those hashes before
  running and refuse to proceed if any file has been altered. That mechanism
  exists for evaluation integrity, but it doubles as evidence that this
  redistribution is unmodified.

  Navigation2 ships no NOTICE file, so no upstream attribution notices are
  reproduced beyond those above.

